      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "A Visko Orbis Stable scene in three segments, one node per segment. The image pins the first frame, and each later prompt keeps the same fisherman, boat and camera while the storm changes, so the video morphs from one segment to the next instead of cutting. Reactor Sequence Visualizer draws the sequence.\n\nLoad Image feeds the first node. Copy example_inputs/reactor_fisherman.jpg from this plugin into ComfyUI's input folder first. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "A Visko Orbis Stable scene in three segments, one node per segment. The image pins the first frame, and each later prompt keeps the same fisherman, boat and camera while the storm changes, so the video morphs from one segment to the next instead of cutting. Reactor Sequence Visualizer draws the sequence.\n\nLoad Image feeds the first node. Copy example_inputs/reactor_fisherman.jpg from this plugin into ComfyUI's input folder first. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
